WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:44.240
Gryps 2 was rendered inoperative
by Haman.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:51.550
For the time, the city on the Moon's surface,
Granada, appeared to have escaped danger.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.020
However, Haman was making
arrangements...

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.050
...to meet with Jamitov of the Titans.

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:04.010
The Gate of Zedan

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:28.680
Haman Karn?

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.920
Yes, a woman totally without shame.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.220
How have you been able to survive
until now?

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:38.460
I... I just strongly believe that I cannot die
until I've defeated my enemy.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.920
Haman also does not wish to die.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.400
I'll accept her request.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:47.230
I'll further accept to meet Haman
outside this base.

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:48.570
Yes, sir.

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.430
What's this?

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:53.940
A good luck charm.
In order to survive.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.110
We don't know what that woman's
got up her sleeve.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.810
If the time comes...

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.480
...use it without hesitation!

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:04.320
- And keep the Dogosse Gier informed!
- Yes, sir!

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:10.560
Katz!

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.290
What is it?

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:15.060
You're skipping meals
to help out with maintenance?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.290
Get some rest.

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:18.670
I've got to do this...

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.600
...so I don't get forgotten around here.

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:22.770
Stop sulking.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:23.810
Kamille!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.740
Could you take this
maintenance report to the bridge?!

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:27.880
Sure!

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.640
I'll take it!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.370
Haven't we received word
from Haman yet?

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.920
She should be at the Gate of Zedan
by now.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:39.350
What do you mean "any word from Haman"?!

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.020
This is none of your concern, Katz.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:46.060
Captain, you and the Lieutenant
lowered your head to Haman the other day!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.530
After going through such disgrace...

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.030
...will you forgive Haman's actions?!

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.330
Stop it, Katz!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.160
That's why I was against it!

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.370
To join with the Zabi Family...!

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.440
We haven't concluded that
Haman's betrayed us.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:03.910
It could be us that get wiped out
next time!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.510
That's possible.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:08.620
However, right now we have no choice
but to trust Haman.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.190
It's always the same!

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:12.460
Katz!

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:15.180
I'm tired of listening to your damn
adult excuses!

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:29.870
Reccoa Londe?

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.170
Thanks for coming, Sarah.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.700
Why that's... the Gwadan.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.110
That's right.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:40.580
The Gwadan's entering
the Gate of Zedan's airspace.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:44.880
As a token of their everlasting friendship
with the Titans.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:47.950
But...!

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:51.550
Of course, I don't trust Haman Karn one bit.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.090
Reccoa feels the same way.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.900
That's precisely why I called you here,
Sarah.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:00.130
Are you going to the Gate of Zedan, sir?

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.170
Yes.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.730
Reccoa and myself.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:05.610
What?! Me, too!

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.270
I'll accompany you!

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.210
No.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:11.250
For this mission,
the two of us will suffice.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.910
The Argama's approaching us...

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:16.980
...so I want you to watch out for enemies
coming from behind.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.250
All right?

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:19.920
Yes, sir.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:26.320
I will only ask those I trust to
operate independently.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.760
I hope you understand.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.590
If those are your orders...

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.800
...I will abide by them.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:48.240
Sarah Zabiarov, taking off!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.200
Mr. Paptimus is insinuating...

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.600
...in order to get me worked up.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:08.660
<i>Chief Petty Officer Sarah.</i>

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.470
<i>When shall we</i>
<i>adjust our direction?</i>

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.730
- We'll continue straight on for now!
- <i>But...</i>

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.210
<i>...we're headed directly towards</i>
<i>the Argama!</i>

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.080
We're decoys!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.950
If you are insinuating...

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:23.250
...then I'll live up to
your expectations, Mr. Paptimus!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.800
Three Titans mobile suits
dead ahead!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.230
They're approaching!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.790
Tell them to move back,
or we won't come any closer!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:38.840
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:43.670
Be careful not to mistake our timing
to contact the Argama.

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:44.710
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.010
Jamitov Hymem.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:48.840
How will he respond?

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:55.750
You want me to send
Katz out to an actual battle?

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:56.750
Yes.

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:00.350
If he's given greater responsibility,
we might see some changes in him.

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:01.890
All right.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:03.190
Let me think about it.

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.230
What's that?!

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:05.760
What is it?

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:09.200
That meteorite! I'm detecting
faint radio waves from it!

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:11.690
It's likely an abandoned meteorite base.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:13.230
Huh?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.360
Those are mobile suits!
Approaching from straight ahead!

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:17.510
How many?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.510
Three!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.540
Are they Scirocco's people?

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.140
I can hear...

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.370
...a voice.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.420
Kamille!

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:26.520
Kamille!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:27.720
Y-Yes, sir!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.050
- What's the matter?
- Nothing, sir.

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.210
- Go out with the Zeta!
- Yes, sir!

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:37.220
Can he feel pressure from the enemy?

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.420
Zeta Gundam, taking off!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.060
Someone's calling.

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:49.740
Who is it?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.840
Here's one. The Zeta!

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.000
Is it Kamille?!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.810
We'll spread out and sandwich it!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:57.710
<i>Roger!</i>

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.360
Got him!

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:19.400
Squall! Do it! Now!

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:21.400
What?!

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:27.700
What are you doing?!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.710
Help me!!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.620
Stay away!!

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:46.560
The mono-eye's been damaged!

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:52.090
That new model...!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.500
Where'd it go?!

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:13.360
Sarah.

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:14.580
Is that Sarah?!

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:15.560
Kamille!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.650
- <i>Stop it, Sarah!</i>
- Shut up!

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.700
If you shoot from that distance,
you won't be safe either!

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:24.490
<i>Who'll be pleased by you going</i>
<i>overboard and hurting yourself?!</i>

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.770
Mr. Paptimus will recognize me!

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:30.200
Don't you realize
that you're only being used?!

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:32.870
It's not something an outsider
like you would understand!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:41.940
Sarah!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.280
Those three are decoys!

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:46.320
Mobile suit team! Get ready to sortie!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.990
Also send Katz out in the Methuss!

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.530
- Not Fa?
- I said Katz!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.500
We're almost in the Gate of Zedan's airspace!

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:58.190
We'll take the Argama right into
the enemy fleet ahead of us!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.360
I know.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.000
I'll remain here.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.450
Is she trying to lure me in there?

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.720
She must have escaped inside!

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.400
This is an air lock.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:33.140
Which means there must be air.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.080
<i>Hurry over, Kamille.</i>

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.480
Is he running away?!

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.790
Let go, Kamille!

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.590
Why do you have to try this hard?

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.030
It's all for Mr. Paptimus!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:09.940
You've already done more than enough
for that guy, Sarah!

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:13.740
If he cared about you,
he wouldn't send you out...

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.240
...on such dangerous missions!

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:17.170
You're wrong!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.650
He has higher hopes for me
than he does for Reccoa!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.120
Reccoa?!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:26.190
That's right! He's using Reccoa
only to motivate me!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:27.280
Stop it!

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:28.460
Sarah!

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:29.750
Wake up!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.490
That man has no sense of virtue!

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.530
You just fail to understand things!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.900
You're the one who fails to understand,
Kamille!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:41.900
Mr. Paptimus...

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.570
...is the one who will usher
humanity into a new era!

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.770
But you'll be used and killed!

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.270
If it's for that man's ideal,
I'd be glad to die!

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:50.380
You fool!

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:53.380
If you die...! If you die,
that ends everything.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:55.780
If you die...!

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:58.720
Kamille...!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:44.460
We're terribly sorry for the inconvenience
we caused you due to our mistake.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.970
- The incident with Gryps 2 was a result of...!
- Skip the formalities!

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:51.300
What is it that you want?

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.540
Depending on your answer,
I may choose to destroy the Gwadan!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.070
I wonder about that.

00:12:57.450 --> 00:13:00.320
Should that happen, Axis will destroy
the Gate of Zedan!

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.580
Axis will?

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:03.620
Yes.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.390
And what do you want?

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.680
The revival of the Zabi Family!

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:11.990
I've already promised you
the revival of the Zabi Family.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.090
Must I seal it with my blood?

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:15.300
A seal of blood?

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:23.400
What does some blood
on a piece of paper prove?!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.940
What I want is your life!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.720
Don't kill her! Capture her!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.340
This earring is filled
with cyanide gas.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.150
I just squeeze it and it'll spurt out.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.490
There's more than enough
to kill every person in this room!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.420
You bitch!

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.720
That decides it.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.700
I will ram Axis
into the Gate of Zedan!

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.200
I won't let you have it so easy!

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:54.160
I'm sorry to say it, but everything
seems to be progressing as planned.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.430
- Miss Haman! Hurry!
- Thank you!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:00.770
I told you not to move!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:16.720
It's a message from the Gwadan!
"Requesting backup" ...that's all.

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:20.160
- Are we ready to send out mobile suits?!
- Yes, sir!

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:21.960
But what about Kamille?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:24.130
We must prioritize backing the Gwadan!

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:26.430
- Inform the Radish as well!
- Yes, sir!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.460
Adjust missiles to targets!

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.060
Avoid the Gwadan!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.440
Fire missiles!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.440
<i>Katz! Ready?! You're next!</i>

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.640
I can't!

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:40.980
I can't go out!

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:43.650
<i>What are you saying?!</i>
<i>You were on standby, right?!</i>

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.660
I can't, if it's to fight for Zeon!

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:48.630
- What's wrong?!
- Katz is acting strange.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:49.920
- What?
- Captain!

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.220
We just received word from Kamille!

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.020
What?!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.120
<i>You're okay?</i>

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.390
Of course!

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:57.660
I'm on my way back!

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:00.500
<i>Wait! Proceed directly to support</i>
<i>the Gwadan!</i>

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.800
The Gwadan?

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:02.930
Damn that Haman!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:05.000
It's just as Mr. Paptimus predicted!

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:07.170
That voice.

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:08.270
Roger.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:10.840
Is it true that you helped Haman?!

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:14.010
One day she's also going to
betray the A.E.U.G.!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.520
Send a thief to catch a thief.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.350
It's Sarah!

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.190
I know it is!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:23.750
But why?

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.630
Whose voice was that?!

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:26.860
<i>Mr. Torres, I'm going!</i>

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.460
Huh? Are you all right, Katz?!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.430
Sure, I'm all right!

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:32.990
<i>Okay! We're counting on you!</i>

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:35.570
Why's she with Kamille?

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:37.270
Methuss, taking off!

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:59.900
Missiles from the A.E.U.G.
are hitting the Gate of Zedan!

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:01.630
What faithful people.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:05.730
They won't be able to pursue us
from the Gate of Zedan.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:09.010
However, we're yet to see how
the Jupitris will react.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.110
Have the Gaza C team
remain where they are!

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.070
Don't take your eyes off the Jupitris!

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:13.940
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.480
Damn Haman.

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:25.250
How shrewd.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.520
We're ready to send out our mobile suits!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.080
Okay!

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.600
It's the Byalant!

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:41.100
This machine belongs to Lieutenant Jerid!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.870
Well... Jerid...!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.950
I'll get you, Haman!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.440
A mobile suit is blasting dummies
as it draws closer.

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.710
Counter it with our Gaza Cs.

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:59.260
Beam fire from dead ahead!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:00.220
Never mind it!

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.990
They aren't hitting us so easily!

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:07.530
Crush the Gwadan!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:09.460
We'll look after the
mobile suits later!

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:10.500
<i>Roger!</i>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:11.970
Out of my way!!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:19.240
What?!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:21.640
It's that man!

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:22.980
Fall!

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.180
What?!

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:29.140
Spread out and protect the Gwadan!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.190
<i>Roger!</i>

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:32.280
The A.E.U.G.!

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:33.920
The Zeta!

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:39.060
Jerid!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.000
Kamille!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:45.740
Not bad!

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:55.670
What?!

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:02.610
Get him!

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:04.420
Launcher?!

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:09.250
It's got a homing device?!

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:17.300
Impossible!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.730
Hold on, Sarah!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.540
Why, that's...!

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:31.640
...the Jupitris!

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.480
Mr. Paptimus...!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:42.880
Where's Jerid?!

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:48.720
Jerid!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:53.030
Enemy mobile suits are spreading out
to the sides.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.070
Tell them to defend the Gwadan
from in close...

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.400
- ...and not to chase after the enemy!
- Yes, sir!

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.100
- Are the Mega Cannons ready?!
- Yes, sir!

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:02.770
They're sending out a larger force
than expected.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:06.080
Does this mean Haman has failed?

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:13.920
Go down, Haman!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.730
What's taking you?!

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:23.160
Rout them with anti-air battery!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.340
Leader Jerid!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:31.200
It's dangerous to pursue them further!

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:32.570
We could be targeted!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.800
So what?! Don't be scared!

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:41.610
What are you doing?!

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:43.590
I won't let you get in Mr. Paptimus's way!

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:50.960
Die, Kamille!

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.270
Do you want to die, too?!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.460
If it's to help Mr. Paptimus, I don't mind!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.010
Sarah!

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:05.970
Where are you, Sarah?!

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:07.370
Kamille, answer me!

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:08.550
Katz!

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:10.010
He's here!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.520
Why are you retreating, Kamille?!

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.390
Are you still not convinced?!

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.920
- Let go, Sarah!
- Katz! Katz!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.420
<i>Sarah! Are you there?!</i>

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.690
Katz, stop it! We're in the midst of a battle!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.000
<i>Katz! Please, Katz!</i>

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:29.030
<i>Stop this fight!</i>

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.860
<i>Stop fighting for Haman!</i>

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.390
Stop it, Sarah!

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:34.440
Stop trying to use Katz again!

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:36.570
Destroy the Gwadan, Katz!

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.610
Are you listening?!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.510
Are you that eager to be
Scirocco's girl?!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.050
Gotcha!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.220
What?!

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.850
He got my vernier!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:01.560
I can't continue!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.940
The enemy's retreating.

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:13.200
Have they given up?

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:19.150
That's enough, Katz! It's over!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.620
<i>Kamille!</i>

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:27.920
<i>Is Sarah... Is Sarah all right?!</i>

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:29.890
Yeah, she's just unconscious.

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:38.060
Katz, you've become a lot stronger.

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:40.330
You're like a different person from before.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.830
Thanks to you, Sarah!

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:48.070
Once you've lost faith in others,
you naturally become more cautious.

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:50.940
It's good to become strong.

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.780
If it's for the person you love.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:54.710
You're right!

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.250
That's what has made you strong!

00:21:58.090 --> 00:21:59.080
All for Scirocco!

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:02.250
- Katz.
- Leave him alone.

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:04.460
Why did you bring her here?!

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:06.260
You knew this would happen!

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:09.760
<i>I still have trouble</i>
<i>with killing people.</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:14.100
<i>Besides, killing can't</i>
<i>be the best solution, can it?</i>

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:24.310
The Gate of Zedan has closed its doors
to Haman Karn.

00:22:24.680 --> 00:22:29.080
However, Axis is approaching,
with the power to crush it.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:45.460 --> 00:23:48.330
The A.E.U.G. and Titans have been
forced to fight it out...

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:50.920
...in the palm of Haman Karn's hand.

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:54.330
In the end, Haman will surely emerge
as the victor.

00:23:55.470 --> 00:24:01.930
Jerid's cries and Reccoa's thoughts
sadly have no bearing on the overall picture.

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:07.480
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Coming From the Heavens".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Coming From the Heavens

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:10.320
You will see the tears of time.
